# SHA-256 of every migration that belongs to a published release, one line each: `<sha256>  <file name>`
# (the output of `shasum -a 256 <file>`). TestReleasedMigrationsUnchanged fails when such a file is edited,
# renamed or removed, and when a migration that is not listed has an older timestamp than a listed one.
# The baseline is frozen at the FINAL tag: the owner appends its hash last, before tagging vX.Y.Z (the release
# workflow fails a final tag without it; pre-releases such as -rc.N pass without). Never change or delete a line:
#   cd backend/migrations && shasum -a 256 20261119111332_baseline.sql >> released.sha256
